><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.4.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.2pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Looks as though 1984, 1988, 2003, 2004 and 2006 all may fall below the baseline. Can you double check and add the relevant years to the text to improve clarity?</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="18" rect="612.000000,564.789000,816.000000,678.789000"
/></highlight
