><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.4.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.2pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Change to: "Increases in the late 90s and early 2000s were  primarily driven by higher than baseline prices. Prices remained strong in the early 2000s- 2006, but revenues declined due to lower landings. The latter half of the time series (post 2006) illustrates higher than baseline revenues, for which the primary driver changes from year to year. The higher revenues in 2024, for example, were driven by higher prices. "</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="18" rect="95.624800,568.875000,299.624000,791.250000"
/></strikeout
