><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260310170717-04'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20260310170727-04'00'" name="6697229a-b969-43b1-9010-9978c415c22b" page="72" coords="183.450000,311.714000,214.817000,311.714000,183.450000,297.597000,214.817000,297.597000" rect="183.009000,297.156000,215.258000,312.155000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Danielle Cholewiak"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.4.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>please see comments below, and remove or revise this figure.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="yes" page="72" rect="612.003000,214.034000,795.931000,311.562000"
/></highlight
><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20260310170356-04'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20260310170659-04'00'" name="314aa94d-ba15-4633-a2ff-29aa4c964296" page="73" coords="56.693000,344.994000,520.658000,344.994000,56.693000,332.262000,520.658000,332.262000" rect="56.295100,331.864000,521.056000,345.392000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Danielle Cholewiak"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.4.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>How is this figure generated? There is no information on how "persistence probability" is generated, which is an incredibly difficult metric to quantify. As such, I find the inclusion of this graphic to be very problematic. If all you need to do is show overlap between NARW areas and WEAs, you can use published literature or do a SPUE analysis.  Stakeholders within the scientific community have previously flagged the problematic nature of this figure. Please consider taking a different approach.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="73" rect="612.003000,143.997000,795.931000,363.925000"
/></highlight
